2
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
South Park: Bigger, Longer & Uncut is a animation,
comedy film directed by Trey Parker.

3
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,000
In this feature film based on the hit animated series, the third graders of South Park sneak into an R-rated film by ultra-vulgar Canadian
television personalities Terrance and Phillip, and emerge with expanded vocabularies that leave their parents and teachers scandalized.

4
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
When outraged Americans try to censor the film, the controversy spirals into a call to wage war on Canada
and Terrance and Phillip end up on death row, with the kids their only hope of rescue.

